Vessel types (from products.csv):
\[
\begin{array}{lll}
\text{ProductName} & \text{Value} & \text{Weight} \\
\text{Speedboat} & 29664 & 18 \\
\text{Fishing Boat} & 31778 & 36 \\
\text{Catamaran} & 73501 & 25 \\
